WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.917
This query keeps the source table once The lateral
VALUES block emits

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:11.629
three rows for each product Each generated row
contains a sale month

00:00:11.643 --> 00:00:17.174
and the corresponding revenue Run the query and
compare the output with

00:00:17.201 --> 00:00:22.862
UNION ALL The two forms should represent the same
long relationship
